['The mutation may alter the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein.', 'The mutation could alter the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein, potentially affecting how it binds to its substrate.', 'The mutation could alter the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein, affecting interactions with distant amino acids and altering binding sites.', 'The mutation may alter the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein, affecting interactions with distant amino acids that influence substrate binding.', 'The mutation may alter the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein, which in turn may affect the binding site and selectivity of the enzyme.', 'The mutation alters the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein. The nonpolar amino acid changes the proteins shape, potentially affecting the substrate binding site.', 'The mutation may alter the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein. This change could affect the binding of substrates to the enzyme, leading to altered substrate specificity.', 'A mutation changed a polar amino acid to a nonpolar one at a site distant from the enzymes active site. This may alter the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein.', 'A mutation in a bacterial enzyme changed a polar amino acid to a nonpolar one, located away from the active site. This could alter substrate specificity by changing the proteins shape.', 'A mutation in a bacterial enzyme changed a polar amino acid to a nonpolar one, altering the enzymes shape. This shape change may affect the enzymes substrate specificity.', 'The mutation alters the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein.', 'The mutation might alter the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein, potentially affecting the binding site for substrates.', 'The mutation may alter the enzymes substrate specificity by changing the shape of the protein. This change could affect the enzymes ability to bind to specific substrates.']
